  hazardName: "Acil \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F y\xF6nlendirme levhas\u0131n\u0131n yere
    d\xFC\u015Fm\xFC\u015F olmas\u0131"
  description: " Acil \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F y\xF6nlendirme levhas\u0131n\u0131n
    yere d\xFC\u015Fm\xFC\u015F olmas\u0131, olas\u0131 bir acil durumda \xE7al\u0131\u015Fanlar\u0131n
    do\u011Fru ka\xE7\u0131\u015F yolunu h\u0131zl\u0131ca bulmas\u0131n\u0131 engelleyerek
    panik, gecikme ve tahliye aksakl\u0131klar\u0131na neden olur. Y\xF6nlendirme
    levhalar\u0131n\u0131n g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr, sa\u011Flam ve do\u011Fru konumda olmas\u0131
    gereklidir."
